  <title type="title-main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Coding of speech at 8 kbit/s using conjugate-structure algebraic-code-excited linear prediction (CS-ACELP)</title>
  <title type="main" format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Coding of speech at 8 kbit/s using conjugate-structure algebraic-code-excited linear prediction (CS-ACELP)</title>
